# CBL Mascot Intro Videos — Claude Integration Guide

## What This Is

Three animated mascot intro videos for the City Bucket List website. Each mascot is a talking character that introduces their role to visitors. They sit side-by-side on a black background with a centered play button — no text overlays, no borders, no autoplay.

